/**
 * The built-in guides that used to ship as React components under
 * apps/intranet/src/components/guidebooks/docs/, converted once to wiki HTML
 * so they can be edited in the wiki like any other page. Only read by the
 * one-time migration (migrations/moveGuidesToWiki.ts): after it has run, the
 * wiki rows are the source of truth and this file is just its input.
 *
 * Screenshots stay in apps/intranet/public/guidebooks/ and are referenced by
 * path (see isBundledImageSrc in the intranet's rich-text sanitizer).
 */

